node_modules/
.next/
.env*
!.env.example
*.log

# The private tokens page is source, not a secret. Some machines carry a global ignore pattern for names that start with
# "token" (to keep credential files out of commits), which silently kept this directory out of the repository while the
# site map, the build and the tests all expect it. Re-include it here: a repository rule outranks a global one.
!/app/tokens/
!/app/tokens/**
